symbol pin_selection
lines 0 51
hash 4d00052c41179649
note 'pin selection' in the top bar, the human's authoring gesture: in the Listing tab, the selected lines become a step of the selected path (Map::add_step, authored Human), under the selected step. The new step becomes the selected one, so pinning again puts the next step under it and a chain is built by clicking down the file. Without selected lines or a selected path it only says what is missing; a refusal from the map is worded by cli.

